orkshop proceedings) in one of these topic areas (pick which), or\n- Find upcoming 2023/2024 dates for a few specific conferences you want to attend.\n\nWhich area should I dig into first \u2014 medical imaging/XAI, sustainable fashion, or DEI/LGBTQ+ workplace inclusion?", "autoeval_label": {"model": "gpt-4o-2024-08-06", "label": true}}
