ness/screen timeout.\n3. Disable unnecessary background refresh, push email, and location.\n4. Use wired fast charging when possible; carry a quality 5\u201310k mAh power bank for your commute.\n5. Avoid heat and extreme charge levels; enable optimized charging.\n6. Monitor battery health; plan replacement if capacity is <80% or performance is degrading fast.\n\nIf you want, tell me:\n- your phone model (iPhone / Android + model), and I\u2019ll give model\u2011specific tweaks and recommend a compatible power bank and cable.", "autoeval_label": {"model": "gpt-4o-2024-08-06", "label": true}}
