uch and a padded divider for the V1.\n\n8) Other useful extras\n- High-quality camera strap (Peak Design Slide/Clutch or HoldFast) for comfort.\n- Color checker / gray card for accurate color and easier post-processing.\n- Small collapsible reflector for portraits/lifestyle.\n- Compact LED panel (Aputure Amaran or similar) if you need continuous light for video or fill.\n\nIf you want, I can:\n- Tailor the list to a specific budget (economy / mid / pro).\n- Recommend exact model numbers for filters, chargers, or a specific camera bag size based on how much gear you carry.\n- Provide links or a shopping checklist for a one\u2011stop purchase plan.\n\nWhich option would you like me to refine first (power, flash modifiers & triggers, tripod head & L\u2011bracket, or bags/cases)?", "autoeval_label": {"model": "gpt-4o-2024-08-06", "label": true}}
